# The Bishop's first job node: a party half worth more than a share off a hit.
#
# Two halves, and GMS keeps them apart. The Bishop's own is flat: 33% final
# damage at master, whatever their INT and whoever is standing with them.
# Everybody else's grows on the BISHOP's INT and is then held to a slice of
# what the Bishop kept -- one blessing split between everybody in the zone, so
# a party of two takes 17% each and a party of three 11%. See AllyIntLever.
#
# GMS's INT steps verbatim, though this game's stats do not reach GMS's: a
# Bishop here tops out near 8,700 INT against the 100,000-plus an endgame GMS
# Bishop carries, so the party is paid a few points rather than the ceiling and
# the attack speed is bought by nobody yet. That is the ratio the description
# states, and rescaling the steps would state a different skill.
#
# The two ladders are smoothed to land GMS's master value exactly: half a point
# of final damage a level against GMS's `18+floor(x/2)`, and 0.35 seconds
# against its `20+floor(x/3)`. Level 1 lands 0.5pp over and 0.15s under.
#
# The cast is kBuffCastMs like every other buff, not the 360ms its animation
# runs: a buff is raised from a sequence, which paces them all alike.
#
# Dropped: the MP half of the recovery, MP being untracked here. Kept though
# nothing reads them yet -- the status clear, and the attack speed, which the
# soft cap at Fastest 1 eats for a party already carrying its own book's +3.
name: "Benediction"
description:
  "Calls upon your holy power to create a consecrated space that empowers and "
  "revitalizes your allies. Increases your Final Damage, and your party's "
  "Final Damage, Attack Speed and HP recovery in proportion to your INT."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP_V skill_order: 1 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
buff {
  duration_seconds: 19.85
  duration_seconds_per_level: 0.35
  base { final_dmg_pct: 0.185 }
  per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.005 }
  ally_base {
    final_dmg_pct: 0.06
    regen_pct: 0.01
    regen_interval_seconds: 2.0
    cures_conditions: true
  }
  ally_int_lever {
    int_step: 3000
    effect { final_dmg_pct: 0.01 }
    cap_is_party_share: true
  }
  ally_int_lever {
    int_step: 2000
    effect { regen_pct: 0.01 }
    cap { regen_pct: 0.10 }
  }
  ally_int_lever {
    int_step: 10000
    effect { attack_speed: 1 }
    cap { attack_speed: 3 }
  }
}
